  "id": "dynamical/asos-parquet",
  "title": "Global Airport Weather GeoParquet (1940-present)",
  "description": "A global archive of decoded METAR surface weather observations from ASOS and AWOS airport weather stations, covering 1940 to present with roughly 1.8 billion records. Each record includes temperature, dewpoint, humidity, wind, precipitation, visibility, and pressure readings alongside per-record station point geometry, partitioned by year as GeoParquet.",
